-- title:
--   A power certificate for a negative real exponent
-- statement:
--   Let $N\ge1$, $q\ge1$, $R_d>0$, and $a,b,R_n$ be natural numbers. If
--   $$R_d^qN^b\le R_n^qN^a,$$
--   then
--   $$N^{-(a-b)/q}\le R_n/R_d.$$
--   The exponents and quotient on the right of the conclusion are interpreted in
--   the real numbers.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/DrMurphyIsIn/Arda/blob/af4fde8972eb6d4e78c7d9a95933b18b81adf52d/telperion/examples/zeta_reflection/lean/EMZetaOfflineCheck.lean#L182-L201

